finalText:
```json
{
  "rootCauses": [
    {
      "cause": "Service port misconfiguration",
      "evidence": "Service c061-svc is configured with TargetPort 9090, but the container in pod c061-app-7797469789-6tqpx is listening on port 8080 via the command 'httpd -f -p 8080'.",
      "impact": "Traffic sent to the service's ClusterIP:80 is being forwarded to the wrong container port (9090 instead of 8080), resulting in no response.",
      "scope": "Affects all clients trying to access the service",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
  "remediation": "Update the service's TargetPort to match the container's actual listening port (8080): kubectl patch service c061-svc -n siclaw-eval-yye-20260602 -p '{\"spec\":{\"ports\":[{\"targetPort\":8080}]}}'"
}
```

